<h1 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;">
  You've been invited to a workspace
</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">
  <%= @inviter.name %> invited you to <strong style="color: #334155;"><%= @account.name %></strong> on Messy. Nothing has changed yet — you join only once you accept, and your existing workspaces are untouched either way.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 28px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-radius: 9999px; background: #3b82f6;">
      <a href="<%= @workspace_link %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 9999px;">
        Review invitation
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5;">
  Sign in as usual with <%= @user.email %> — the invitation is waiting in the app, so this link isn't the only way in. If you weren't expecting it, ignore this email or decline; until you accept, <%= @account.name %> can't see anything about your account.
</p>
